{"ref":"BDB, מִישָׁאֵל","hw":"מִישָׁאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִישָׁאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Who is what God is?</em> Assyrian form., cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מְתוּשָׁאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_מְתוּשָׁאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">מְתוּשָׁאֵל</a>: note also in Thothmes’ list of towns <em>Ba</em><sup>i</sup><em>-t</em><sup>i</sup><em>-ša-’-rḁ</em>, i.e. prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּיתְשָׁאֵל</span>, Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּיתְאֵל</span> WMM<sup>As. Eur. 193</sup><strong>)</strong>:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a. cousin of Moses <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:22\" href=\"/Exodus.6.22\">Ex 6:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.4\">Lv 10:4</a> (P).<br><strong>2.</strong>  one of Daniel’s companions <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:6\" href=\"/Daniel.1.6\">Dn 1:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:7\" href=\"/Daniel.1.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:11\" href=\"/Daniel.1.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:19\" href=\"/Daniel.1.19\">19</a> + <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:17\" href=\"/Daniel.2.17\">2:17</a> (Aramaic), elsewhere in c. 2–3 called <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵישַׁךְ</span> (1:7).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.4\">Ne 8:4</a>.","next":"BDB, מֵידְבָא","prev":"BDB, מִיכָא"}